ch and how much time you have. The app then generates a short list of carefully selected options designed to fit your current context.\n\nEach recommendation includes a match score and a clear explanation, so you understand why it was chosen for you. This makes it easier to decide quickly without second-guessing or switching between apps.\n\nThe experience is intentionally simple:\n• No overwhelming feeds\n• No infinite scrolling\n• No cluttered discovery pages\n\nJust a focused way to decide what to watch.\n\nYou can still explore details like cast, reviews, and trailers when needed, but these are secondary to the core decision flow.\n\nKey features:\n• Context-based recommendations using mood, time, and attention\n• Clear match scores with explanation\n• Limited, high-quality choices instead of long lists\n• Quick reshuffle for new options\n• Clean and distraction-free interface\n• Save picks and revisit recent decisions\n\nDesigned for moments when you don’t want to browse — you just want to watch.\n\nIf choosing what to watch feels harder than it should, this app simplifies the process into something fast, clear, and intentional.\n\nData Source:\n\nMovie and television information, including posters, artwork, and summaries, is provided by The Movie Database (TMDB). This app uses the TMDB API but is not endorsed, certified, or officially associated with TMDB.\n\nDisclaimer:\n\nThis is an independent movie discovery tool and is not affiliated with or endorsed by any film studios, production companies, or streaming platforms. It does not host, upload, or stream movies or TV shows. All trademarks, logos, and copyrighted materials belong to their respective owners.", "minimumOsVersion": "15.6", "sellerUrl": "https://kuldeepsingh1.netlify.app", "languageCodesISO2A": ["EN"], "fileSizeBytes": "57272320", "formattedPrice": "무료", "trackContentRating": "17+", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion": 4.52632, "userRatingCount": 19}]}